
deck @term/zone
  head <Secret access: bind a machine, hold its credential in the system keystore, call commands with temporary secrets>
  text <The Term Secret Access Library>
  mark <0.0.2>
  test ./test
  line ./code/line
  make <security>
  make <secrets>
  make <configuration>
  make <library>
  cite <Lance Pollard>, base <lp@elk.fm>
  lock <Apache-2.0>
  link @term/base, mark <0.0.x>
